# Generated per-verse Erdelyi scores; regenerate via
# tool/import_reformatus_scores.py. Per-verse files are gitignored and
# regenerated locally, except the ref48-fallback sets whose sources
# cannot be regenerated from the publisher PDFs (the untracked ref48
# pack above). Downloaded score-page PNGs are provenance only.
assets/referdelyi/*-001.png
assets/referdelyi/*-v*.svg
!assets/referdelyi/referdelyi-177-v*.svg
